{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12376","headline":"送严士良侍奉詹事南游 · 钱起","name":"送严士良侍奉詹事南游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"疏傅独知止，曾参善爱亲。\n江山侍行迈，长幼出嚣尘。\n握手想千古，此心能几人。\n风光满长陌，草色傍征轮。\n日夕望荆楚，莺鸣芳杜新。\n渔烟月下浅，花屿水中春。\n点翰遥相忆，含情向白苹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12376.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12376","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}